tatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:63017","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c29921","characterName":"國東 清華・エクィテス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44626","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"303919"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9966"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29921"},"originalCharacterName":"國東 清華・エクィテス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The dark-skinned heroine of this work, who attends Santo Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a young lady from a good family who lives in a large mansion with maids and butlers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kunisaki has the blood of an excellent exorcist (demon exorcist) in her veins, so much so that an Indian aristocrat was once bought by the British royal family and welcomed into the aristocracy. The family has a long line of demon exorcisers who have exorcised demons in Japan for generations. Seika is the most powerful of her family. She used her powers to leave Japan and become an exorcist based in England. She uses the Misericorde dagger, a sword blessed by the cathedral, as her weapon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is older than Ryusuke and is a returnee."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was born in Japan, but spent a long time as an aristocrat there, so she is quite selfish, arrogant, and proud. She behaves condescendingly, especially towards Ryusuke, because they are in a master-servant relationship. She doesn't mind her servants seeing her skin, and often makes Ryusuke help her get changed and take a bath."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her good looks make her popular with the boys at school. Many people like being treated harshly by beautiful women, and as the granddaughter of the Yamato Academy's owner, she is nicknamed Seika-sama."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she would normally choose a partner when she gets her first period, known as the Fertilizer who will replenish her spiritual power, she has yet to decide on one, and it seems her grandfather, the head of the family, is trying to decide for her without her permission."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She does not like the master-servant relationship between Ryusuke and Umihime, and has been growing increasingly irritated since Umihime appeared."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29921"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"山都学園に通う本作の褐色ヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メイドや執事がいるような大きな館に住む良家のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"古くから日本でも代々鬼を駆逐してきた鬼やらいの家系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清華は一族の中でも飛び抜けて強い力の持ち主。その実力を生かして日本を離れ、イギリスを拠点にエクソシストとして活躍していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖堂で祝福を受けた短剣ミセリコルデを武器とする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介より年上の先輩で、帰国子女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本生まれだが向こうでの貴族生活が長かったためか、かなり我が儘で高飛車、プライドも高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に龍介など主従の関係なので見下した態度を取る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"従者には肌を見られても平気ならしく、着替えや風呂に入るのを龍介に手伝わせたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗なので学校では男子に人気あり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美人にきつい態度で接されるのがいいという輩も多く、山都学園の経営者の孫ということもあって清華様と呼ばれている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9966","sourceWorkId":"15578","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"山都学園に通う少女。メイドや執事がいるような大きな館に住む良家のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"國東には、昔インドの貴族がその腕をイギリス王室に買われ貴族として迎え入れられたほどの優秀なエクソシスト （鬼やらい＝退魔師） の血が入っている。古くから日本でも代々鬼を駆逐してきた鬼やらいの家系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清華は一族の中でも飛び抜けて強い力の持ち主。その実力を活かして日本を離れ、イギリスを拠点にエクソシストとして活躍していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖堂で祝福を受けた短剣ミセリコルデを武器とする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・龍介より年上の先輩で、帰国子女。日本生まれだが向こうでの貴族生活が長かったためか、かなりワガママで高飛車、プライドも高い。特に龍介など主従の関係なので見下した態度を取る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"従者には肌を見られても平気らしく、着替えや風呂に入るのを龍介に手伝わせたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"容姿端麗なので学園では男子に人気あり。美人にきつい態度で接されるのがいいという輩も多く、山都学園の経営者の孫ということもあって清華様と呼ばれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来なら初潮を迎える頃に選ぶはずの、自身に霊力を補給してくれる “精授の者” と呼ばれるパートナーを未だ決めておらず、当主である祖父に勝手に決められそうになっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介と海姫が主従関係であることをよく思っておらず、海姫が現れてからはイライラが募っている様子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44626"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/3902f56efad4417484774f0e086fc8aa6877657c881480d2a82ea3cc885d1154.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b7616794f54003a67d5df56300b8bfd98b5ff5d1ab3c94a9607ccf934dc8d899.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ミルノ純","creatorId":"vndb:s564","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s564","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s564","name":"ミルノ 純","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:190545:44626:6167:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c29922","characterName":"海姫","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44627","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"303919"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9967"],"vndbCharacterId":"c29922"},"originalCharacterName":"海姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作のサブヒロイン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美女の姿をしているが高位の鬼。生き物の血を糧とする吸血種。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧南風家の蔵に封印されていたのを解き放たれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"封印を解いて貰ったせいか、龍介を主と呼び従う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介が清華と主従の関係にあるのが不満。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介の傍いるのは自分だと思っていて、いつか清華を食ってやろうと密かに企んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はあまり口数の多い方ではないが、龍介に危険が及ぶと高位の鬼としての力を解放して仲間である鬼を蹴散らす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介を守るためなら自身の消滅すらいとわない、強い思いを持つ鬼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介に触れて貰うのを最上の悦びとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"龍介を助けはするがその対価を必要とし、龍介の精液を求める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拒むと鋭い爪を突き付けて殺すと脅しながら、強制的に精液を奪い取る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9967","sourceWorkId":"15578","spoiler":false},{"s